For `type=dict` or `list` with `elements=dict`: `apply_defaults` (use sub-option defaults when unset), plus nested `options`, `mutually_exclusive`, `required_if`, `required_by`, `required_together`, `required_one_of`.

Custom type via delegate:
```powershell
$spec = @{
    uint64_type = @{ type = [Func[[Object], [UInt64]]]{ [System.UInt64]::Parse($args[0]) } }
}
```
